<title>GERMANY: Bayer reaffirms 1997 sales, profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Bayer reaffirms 1997 sales, profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and pharmaceuticals group Bayer AG reaffirmed on Tuesday its forecast for 1997 sales to top 50 billion marks and for a rise in profit.</p>
<p>Bayer said group net sales in the first half of the year rose 11 percent to 27.4 billion marks and that pre-tax profit rose 2.5 percent to 2.8 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
